# Shell scripts must keep LF endings regardless of platform — a CRLF shebang script
# breaks with a cryptic "bad interpreter" / "$'\r': command not found" error, which is
# exactly the class of silent-platform-divergence bug this project treats as a first-
# class risk (see docs/assumptions.md and the DATABASE_URL finding in Day 1).
.githooks/* text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
